<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/claim-worksheets/">Worksheets</a></li><li aria-current="page">RCV / ACV Holdback Calculator</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator</p><h1>RCV / ACV Depreciation &amp; Holdback Calculator</h1><p class="lede">Most replacement cost policies pay in two stages: actual cash value first, then the depreciation holdback after repairs. Enter each item’s cost, age and expected life to see both.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
